{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chicklet is a mind-bending puzzle game where an adorable chick tries to escape from a pixelated, multi-dimensional machine. Trapped in a world filled with complex and innovative puzzles, the chick needs your help. Players must use various levers and mechanisms on each level to manipulate the pages and guide the chick to the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887400/extras/25765dca5146852fff61ee50f675c699.poster.avif?t=1755863153\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887400/extras/25765dca5146852fff61ee50f675c699.webm?t=1755863153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887400/extras/25765dca5146852fff61ee50f675c699.mp4?t=1755863153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control the levers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each lever opens or closes a page. Activate them in the correct order to lead the chick to the portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887400/extras/a333037566d53d9ed27cfc08d90e9fb8.poster.avif?t=1755863153\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887400/extras/a333037566d53d9ed27cfc08d90e9fb8.webm?t=1755863153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887400/extras/a333037566d53d9ed27cfc08d90e9fb8.mp4?t=1755863153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Store &amp; Visuals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"